{"articleNo":"505496","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&articleNo=505496&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[장학] 2025 GKS Admission Call for Graduate School Studying at KIT, Korea","writer":"국제교류교육원","writeDate":"2025.01.31","hit":"14446","attachments":[{"name":"2025 GKS-G Application Guidelines (English).pdf","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=505496&attachNo=140586"},{"name":"2025 GKS-G Application Guidelines (Korean).pdf","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=505496&attachNo=140587"},{"name":"2025 GKS-G Application Forms.docx","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=505496&attachNo=140588"},{"name":"2025 GKS-G Overview of University(Kumoh).pdf","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=505496&attachNo=140590"},{"name":"★2025_GKS_Available_Field_of_Study_KIT.pdf","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=505496&attachNo=141197"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:white;word-break:break-hangul\"><a name=\"_Hlk98745578\"><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:\n&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:black\">2025&nbsp;</span></b></a><span style=\"mso-bookmark:_Hlk98745578\"><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\nfont-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#0900FF\">GKS Admission Call</span></b></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark:_Hlk98745578\"><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\nfont-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:black\">&nbsp;for Graduate School Studying\nat KIT, Korea</span></b></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark:_Hlk98745578\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;nanum gothic&quot;;color:#212121\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:white;word-break:break-hangul\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark:_Hlk98745578\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\nfont-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#212121\">&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark:_Hlk98745578\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\nfont-family:&quot;nanum gothic&quot;;color:#212121\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:white;word-break:break-hangul\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark:_Hlk98745578\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\nfont-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#212121\">We are pleased to inform you of\n2025&nbsp;GKS (Global Korea Scholarship) Guideline for Master’s and Doctoral\ncandidates here in Korea.&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark:_Hlk98745578\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;nanum gothic&quot;;color:#212121\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:white;word-break:break-hangul\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark:_Hlk98745578\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\nfont-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#212121\">As the one and only national\nengineering specialized university in Korea, we will be able to nominate\ncandidates up to 25. This might be a great opportunity for you to be able to\nstudy in Korea with a full government scholarship.&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark:_Hlk98745578\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\nfont-family:&quot;nanum gothic&quot;;color:#212121\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:white;word-break:break-hangul\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark:_Hlk98745578\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\nfont-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#212121\">Please see attached for further\ninformation and if there are any candidates interested in this program, please\nsend me&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark:_Hlk98745578\"><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:red\">one\noriginal application document package no later than March 31<sup>st</sup> (Monday),\n2025</span></b></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark:_Hlk98745578\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#212121\">. Your\noriginal application documents must be delivered to my office by the deadline.</span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark:_Hlk98745578\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\nfont-family:&quot;nanum gothic&quot;;color:#212121\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:white;word-break:break-hangul\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark:_Hlk98745578\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\nfont-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#212121\">&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark:_Hlk98745578\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\nfont-family:&quot;nanum gothic&quot;;color:#212121\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:white;word-break:break-hangul\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark:_Hlk98745578\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\nfont-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#212121\">&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark:_Hlk98745578\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\nfont-family:&quot;nanum gothic&quot;;color:#212121\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:white;word-break:break-hangul\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark:_Hlk98745578\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\nfont-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#212121\">1. Applicants' GPA must be more\nthan 2.64 on a 4.0 scale, 2.80 on a 4.3 scale, 2.91 on a 4.5 scale, 3.23 on a\n5.0 scale, or score percentile of 80% from your university.</span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark:_Hlk98745578\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\nfont-family:&quot;nanum gothic&quot;;color:#212121\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:white;word-break:break-hangul\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark:_Hlk98745578\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\nfont-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#212121\">And if the transcript does not\ncontain information about overall CGPA or if it is difficult to convert, please\nsubmit additional official explanation data of your university.</span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark:_Hlk98745578\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\nfont-family:&quot;nanum gothic&quot;;color:#212121\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:white;word-break:break-hangul\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark:_Hlk98745578\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\nfont-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#212121\">&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark:_Hlk98745578\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\nfont-family:&quot;nanum gothic&quot;;color:#212121\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:white;word-break:break-hangul\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark:_Hlk98745578\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\nfont-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#212121\">2.&nbsp;Applicants who submit\napplications to more than two designated institutions will be disqualified.</span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark:_Hlk98745578\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\nfont-family:&quot;nanum gothic&quot;;color:#212121\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:white;word-break:break-hangul\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark:_Hlk98745578\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\nfont-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#212121\">&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark:_Hlk98745578\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\nfont-family:&quot;nanum gothic&quot;;color:#212121\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:white;word-break:break-hangul\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark:_Hlk98745578\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\nfont-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#212121\">3.&nbsp;Scholarship duration:\nMaster's(1 yr. of Korean Language + 2 yrs. of Master'), Doctoral(1 yr. of\nKorean Language + 3 yrs. of Doctoral)</span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark:\n_Hlk98745578\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;nanum gothic&quot;;\ncolor:#212121\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:white;word-break:break-hangul\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark:_Hlk98745578\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\nfont-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#212121\">*In the case that scholar could\nnot be able to complete one’s degree within scholarship duration, scholar\nshould take care of one’s living expenses by oneself.</span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark:_Hlk98745578\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\nfont-family:&quot;nanum gothic&quot;;color:#212121\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:white;word-break:break-hangul\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark:_Hlk98745578\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\nfont-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#212121\">4.&nbsp;Applicants must be under\n40 years of age as of Sep.1<sup>st</sup>, 2025(born after Sep. 1, 1985).</span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark:_Hlk98745578\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\nfont-family:&quot;nanum gothic&quot;;color:#212121\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:white;word-break:break-hangul\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark:_Hlk98745578\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\nfont-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#212121\">5. Applicants’ degree documents and\nnationality documents MUST be apostilled or&nbsp;<span style=\"letter-spacing:\n-.25pt\">consular-confirmed.</span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark:_Hlk98745578\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;nanum gothic&quot;;color:#212121\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:white;word-break:break-hangul\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark:_Hlk98745578\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\nfont-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#212121\">All required documents must be\nwritten by computer typing and send us one original document by post only (no\ne-mail application will be accepted). We don’t have online application for this\nGKS admission.</span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark:_Hlk98745578\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;nanum gothic&quot;;color:#212121\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:white;word-break:break-hangul\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark:_Hlk98745578\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\nfont-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#212121\">For further information, please\nsee attached, visit website (</span></span><a href=\"http://eng.kumoh.ac.kr/\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark:_Hlk98745578\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\nfont-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">http://eng.kumoh.ac.kr</span></span></a><span style=\"mso-bookmark:_Hlk98745578\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\nfont-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#212121\">) or contact GKS coordinator.</span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark:_Hlk98745578\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\nfont-family:&quot;nanum gothic&quot;;color:#212121\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"word-break:break-hangul\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark:\n_Hlk98745578\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\ncolor:#002060\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"word-break:break-hangul\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark:\n_Hlk98745578\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\ncolor:#002060\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"word-break:break-hangul\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark:\n_Hlk98745578\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\ncolor:#002060\">Below is the deadline and the address for the application. Thank\nyou. <o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"word-break:break-hangul\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark:\n_Hlk98745578\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\ncolor:#002060\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:white;word-break:break-hangul\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark:_Hlk98745578\"><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\nfont-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:red\">Submission Deadline:&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></b></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark:_Hlk98745578\"><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\nfont-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:black;background:yellow\">March 31<sup>st</sup>,\n(Monday), 2025</span></b></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark:_Hlk98745578\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;nanum gothic&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:\nCalibri;color:#212121\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:white;word-break:break-hangul\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark:_Hlk98745578\"><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\nfont-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:red\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></b></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:white;word-break:break-hangul\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark:_Hlk98745578\"><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\nfont-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:red\">Submission address:</span></b></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark:_Hlk98745578\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\nfont-family:&quot;nanum gothic&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;color:#212121\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:white;word-break:break-hangul\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark:_Hlk98745578\"><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\nfont-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:black\">61 Daehak-ro, Gumi, Gyeongbuk, Korea,</span></b></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark:_Hlk98745578\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\nfont-family:&quot;nanum gothic&quot;;color:#212121\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:white;word-break:break-hangul\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark:_Hlk98745578\"><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\nfont-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:black\">Kumoh National Institute of\nTechnology</span></b></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark:_Hlk98745578\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;nanum gothic&quot;;color:#212121\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:white;word-break:break-hangul\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark:_Hlk98745578\"><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\nfont-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:black\">International Programs and Language\nEducation Center</span></b></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark:_Hlk98745578\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;nanum gothic&quot;;color:#212121\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:white;word-break:break-hangul\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark:_Hlk98745578\"><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\nfont-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:black\">International Education Building, 1<sup>st</sup>&nbsp;floor,\nE103 (Postal Code 39177)</span></b></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark:_Hlk98745578\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;nanum gothic&quot;;color:#212121\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:white;word-break:break-hangul\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark:_Hlk98745578\"><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\nfont-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:red\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></b></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:white;word-break:break-hangul\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark:_Hlk98745578\"><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\nfont-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:red\">Contact Person:</span></b></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark:_Hlk98745578\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\nfont-family:&quot;nanum gothic&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;color:#212121\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:white;word-break:break-hangul\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark:_Hlk98745578\"><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\nfont-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:black\">Eugene Park</span></b></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark:_Hlk98745578\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\nfont-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#000066\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:3.75pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:\n3.75pt;margin-left:0cm\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark:_Hlk98745578\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#000066\">Office)\n+82-54-478-7221, Fax) +82-54-478-7222<o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:3.75pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:\n3.75pt;margin-left:0cm\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark:_Hlk98745578\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#000066\">Email)\n</span></span><a href=\"mailto:meugene@kumoh.ac.kr,%20eugenepark.kit@gmail.com\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark:_Hlk98745578\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\nfont-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">eugene@kumoh.ac.k